<title>UK: Bookies say UK Budget speech to last 81-85 minutes.</title>
<headline>Bookies say UK Budget speech to last 81-85 minutes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bookmakers William Hill said they had opened a book on the length of Chancellor of the Exchequer Gordon Brown's Budget speech on Wednesday.</p>
<p>They anticipate it will last between 81 and 85 minutes, their 3-1 favourite.</p>
<p>Hills have divided the possible length of the speech into five minute chunks. 86-90 is quoted at 7-2, 76-80 at 4-1, with 111-115 at 33-1 and 41-45 at 100-1.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7947</p>
